#: kio_floppy.cpp:200
msgid ""
"drive %1.\n"
"The drive is still busy.\n"
"Wait until it has stopped working and then try again."
msgstr ""
"pemacu %1.\n"
"Pemacu masih sibuk.\n"
"Tunggu sehingga berhenti dan cuba lagi."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:204 kio_floppy.cpp:1118
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably full."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di dalam pemacu %1 berkemungkinan penuh."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:214
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %1"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kemungkinan tiada cakera di dalam pemacu %1"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:218
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %1 or you don't have enough "
"permissions to access the drive."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kemungkinan tiada cakera di dalam pemacu %1 atau anda tiada keizinan yang "
"cukup untuk mencapai pemacu itu."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:222
msgid ""
"\n"
"The drive %1 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pemacu %1 tidak disokong."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:227
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure the floppy in drive %1 is a DOS formatted floppy disk \n"
"and that the permissions of the device file (e.g. /dev/fd0) are set "
"correctly (e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pastikan cakera liut di pemacu %1 ialah cakera liut berformat DOS \n"
"dan keizinan untuk fail peranti (cth. /dev/fd0) ditetapkan dengan betul "
"(cth. rwxrwxrwx)."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:231
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably not a DOS formatted floppy disk."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di pemacu %1 mungkin bukan cakera liut berformat DOS."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:235
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably write-protected."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di pemacu %1 mungkin dilindung-tulis."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:279 kio_floppy.cpp:506 kio_floppy.cpp:597 kio_floppy.cpp:730
#: kio_floppy.cpp:807 kio_floppy.cpp:893 kio_floppy.cpp:973
#: kio_floppy.cpp:1072
msgid ""
"\n"
"Ensure that the mtools package is installed correctly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pastikan pakej mtools dipasang dengan betul pada sistem anda."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:553 kio_floppy.cpp:568 kio_floppy.cpp:572 kio_floppy.cpp:642
msgid "Reason unknown."
msgstr "Sebab tidak diketahui."
